%% EvaporChain — Data Availability Flow

flowchart LR
    A[Block body<br/>txs + blobs] --> B[2D erasure encode<br/>RS over BLS12-381 field]
    B --> C[k×k data matrix<br/>extended to 2k×2k]
    C --> D[Row commitments<br/>cell proofs per row]
    C --> E[Column commitments<br/>cell proofs per column]
    D --> F[data_root<br/>Merkle root of row+col commits]
    E --> F

    F --> G[Block header<br/>data_root field]
    G --> H[Validators sign DA attestation<br/>BLS over hash#40;data_root, height#41;]
    H --> I{Supermajority?<br/>signing stake × 3 ≥ total × 2}
    I -->|no| Z[Block remains unfinalized<br/>for DA enforcement]
    I -->|yes| J[DA Certificate<br/>aggregate BLS sig + signer_ids]

    J --> K[PoHA: certificate hash<br/>committed in next block]

    L[Light client] --> M[Random sample<br/>seed = blake3#40;height ‖ vid ‖ idx#41;]
    M --> N[Request cell #40;r,c#41; from peer]
    N --> O{Cell + proof verify<br/>against row_root + col_root?}
    O -->|no| P[Mark peer faulty]
    O -->|yes| Q[Sample passed]
    Q --> R[After s samples,<br/>DA assured to high prob]

    style Z fill:#f8d7da
    style J fill:#d1e7dd
    style R fill:#d1e7dd

